## Distributed runtime

NeonForge installers contain the NeonForge application bundle and package
metadata only. They do not bundle third-party JavaScript packages, model
weights, a browser engine, or the Node.js runtime.

NeonForge imports only Node.js built-in modules at runtime. Node.js 22 or newer
is a user-provided prerequisite and is not part of the NeonForge artifact.
